    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present No. 2 Connolly Gardens to the market, an exceptional three-bedroom home tucked away in a quiet, mature enclave in the heart of Dublin 8. Renovated in 2015 and continuously upgraded by its current owners, this turn-key residence offers a fantastic opportunity to secure a turn-key home in a highly convenient location. \n\nUpon entering through the newly fitted composite front door, you are welcomed by a bright, inviting entrance hall that leads into the main sitting room, featuring custom built-in alcove shelving framing an open fireplace. To the rear, the house expands into an impressive kitchen extension added in 2015, featuring underfloor heating and twin skylights. Double doors open directly onto a private, south-facing rear garden with a paved patio. The ground floor also benefits from a guest WC added in 2015.\n\nUpstairs, the accommodation comprises three well-proportioned bedrooms, with custom built-in wardrobes fitted in the two main rooms, alongside high-quality timber doors installed in 2023. The family bathroom was also completely replaced in 2023. \n\nThe property has been meticulously maintained and upgraded throughout, benefiting from a brand-new gas boiler, double glazing, a security alarm system, and new front perimeter fencing, framing the off-street parking area.\n\nNo. 2 is situated in a highly convenient location, just a 5-minute walk from the Goldenbridge LUAS stop, offering easy access into Dublin City Centre. Local shops, schools, and popular village cafés are all within comfortable walking distance. Major infrastructure and amenities including St. James's Hospital (site of the new National Children's Hospital), Heuston Station, and Phoenix Park are easily accessible, while the nearby M50, M4, and M6 motorway networks provide seamless road links across the region."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.40m x 1.56m\n\n\nLiving Room - 4.26m x 3.88m\n\n\nKitchen - 5.54m x 2.87m\n\n\nDining Area - 3.88m x 2.62m\n\n\nBedroom - 3.38m x 3.78m\n\n\nSecond Bedroom - 3.78m x 3.38m\n\n\nThird Bedroom - 2.78m x 2.05m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.05m x 1.81m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Superb three bedroom property in excellent condition throughout</li><li> Meauring approx 100 Sq. M / 1,076 Sq. ft</li><li> Off-street parking</li><li> South facing garden</li><li> Brand new gas boiler, double-glazing throughout and underfloor heating</li><li> Well-proportioned accommodation</li><li> 5-minute walk to the Goldenbridge LUAS stop for easy access to Dublin City Centre</li><li> Excellent transport links on your doorstep</li><li> Within walking distance to Inchicore village and a variety of cafes, shops and restaurants</ul>"
      },
